   Beery, Thomas, Kristianstad Univ, Fac Nat Sci Sustainable Multifunct Landscapes, Kristianstad, Sweden.
   Olafsson, Anton Stahl; Gentin, Sandra; Maurer, Megan, Univ Copenhagen, Dept Geosci \& Nat Resource Management, Frederiksberg, Denmark.
   Stalhammar, Sanna, Swedish Univ Agr Sci, Dept Landscape Architecture Planning \& Management, Lomma, Sweden.
   Albert, Christian, Ruhr Univ Bochum, Inst Geog, Bochum, Germany.
